Urgency: medium
Maintainer: fehlix <fehlix@mxlinux.org>
Changed-By: fehlix <fehlix@mxlinux.org>
Description:
 uc-tool-mx - Generate and inject AMD/Intel microcode CPIO images into initrd
Changes:
 uc-tool-mx (26.10.1) mx; urgency=medium
 .
   * Add --ucode=auto and make it the default: build microcode for each
     vendor whose firmware (and for Intel: iucode_tool) is available,
     skip the others with a warning, and fail only if none is available.
     An explicit vendor list (amd, intel, amd,intel) stays strict.
   * Remove stale amd-ucode.img/intel-ucode.img of vendors not built in
     the current run from the output dir, so a leftover from an earlier
     run is never silently injected into the initrd.
   * Drop the unused ucode-*.img glob from the initrd update.
